        {
          "text": " Kandi iwe Mwana w'omuntu, gira rurara y'obwogi, ogikorese nk'orumweiso rw'omumwi, omwe omutwe gwawe n'ebireju byawe; bwanyima ogire eminzaani y'okupimisa, obone kubaganisa eishokye. ",
