            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebiro by'okugota ku birihwa, kimwe kya kashatu kyaryo okyokyeze ahagati y'orurembo; kimwe kya kashatu kyaryo ekindi okitware, oyehinguririze orurembo nookitemesa rurara; kandi kimwe kya kashatu kyaryo ekindi okumaamagize omu mwanya, kitwarwe omuyaga; naanye ndyasyorayo rurara, ngibikuratse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
