        {
          "text": " nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugambira naagira ati: Reeba, nyowe, nyowe buzima naaba omubisha waawe, ndyakureetamu ebifubiro, amahanga nigakireeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
