          "text": " Nikyo baishe b'abaana na batabani baabo bariryanirira omuriiwe, nkakureetaho ebifubiro, kandi ab'omuriiwe abariba bahonokireho, nkabataataanisiza ei emiyaga yona ereetwa. ",
